      "functional_impact_measured": "Surface detection confirmed: the extracellular Myc tag (myc e) enabled antibody-based detection of the full-length membrane-anchored \u03b21 at the cell surface. Electrophysiological function of the myc c&e construct specifically was NOT MEASURED in the cited study; functional assays were performed on separate N-terminal deletion constructs.",
