          "claim": "To make a construct with both extracellular and C-terminal myc tags (myc c&e ), site-directed mutagenesis with primers 5\u2032-AGCCAAATTCCAAGAGCAGAAACTCATCTCAGAAGAGGATCTTCAGG (fwd) and 5\u2032-AAGCAGTAGAAGACCTGAAGATCCTCTTCTGAGATGAGTTTCTGC (rev) were used to introduce this additional myc e tag between Gln-131 and Gln-132 of \u03b21-subunit.",
